{"about_the_game":"I found myself in a strange house and I'm scared. I think I got into some kind of loop. The house is constantly changing, surely I saw something inexplicable and terrible. I have to get out of here. Every time I go through a cycle, one of the chains on the basement door disappears. I should probably get in there and get out of here. I'm very scared.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379590/extras/9597e32aaebfda91398588daf9c2d869.avif?t=1758470430\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Anomaly search game<br></li><li>Huge number of anomalies<br></li><li>Several endings<br></li><li>Creepy atmosphere<br></li><li>Psychological horror<br></li><li>Achievements</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379590/extras/2c3bc0a0e443867b138572b08192c520.avif?t=1758470430\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore the strange house.<br></li><li>If you find an anomaly, turn back immediately.<br></li><li>If you don't find any anomalies, do not turn back.<br></li><li>There are no anomalies on the first level.<br></li><li>Try to get out of here.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379590/extras/858654c74223ce5bcce8ede4b502c62a.avif?t=1758470430\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Special thanks to Nix Ellison and\u00a0Sergej Kuzmin.<br>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1st floor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3379590/b8ede75198db620f7f8df9aa9b5025ccab276e6f.jpg"},{"name":"Idealist #1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3379590/5b5bc9eff9007062e251648e682e3dc42bda516e.jpg"},{"name":"The worst decision in Horror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstat